// rule-evidence: docs/design/vips/0027-declaration-output.md#amendment-bun-project-scripts | **Amended 2026-11-01: documented schemas.** A JSDoc comment on a `schema` declaration is emitted on its `declare const` only; its synthesized `typeof Name.Type` alias has no comment.
// rule-evidence: docs/design/vips/0027-declaration-output.md#6f42980fb6df70ed
// rule-evidence: docs/design/vips/0027-declaration-output.md#amendment-bun-project-scripts | Native `removeComments` and `stripInternal` behavior is unchanged.
// run.mjs compiles this file under default, `removeComments` and `stripInternal` options and requires stock tsc's bytes for typescript/main.ts.

/** A user. */
export schema User {
  /** The id. */
  readonly id: string
}

/**
 * A legacy name.
 * @deprecated Use User.
 */
export schema Legacy = string

/**
 * The codes.
 * @internal
 */
export schema Code = "a" | "b"

/** @public The visible name. */
export schema Name = string

/** A constant after the schemas. */
export const after = 1
